======================================================================

Run:

    git diff
    git status

Expected likely file:

    .drone.star

Do NOT add:
- scripts unless absolutely necessary
- cache contents
- generated files
- reports
- docs
- timing artefacts
- unrelated changes

Prefer a small .drone.star-only implementation.

